        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result of portfolio prioritization and emerging clinical data, we discontinued a number of programs in 2025 as we focus our research and development efforts.",
        "start_character": 66616,
        "end_character": 66778
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001682852-26-000033",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001682852-26-000033-69cb479aa6f78a0f",
        "accession_number": "0001682852-26-000033",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As further described below, as we continue the development of our intended products, we continue to identify additional means of protecting our assets that would potentially enhance commercial success, including possible patent protection for additional methods of use, formulation, or manufacture.",
        "start_character": 104627,
        "end_character": 104925
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001682852-26-000033",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001682852-26-000033-69cb479aa6f78a0f",
        "accession_number": "0001682852-26-000033",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we scale manufacturing output for each program, we plan to continuously improve yield, purity and the pharmaceutical properties of our product candidates.",
        "start_character": 76152,
        "end_character": 76309
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001682852-26-000033",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001682852-26-000033-69cb479aa6f78a0f",
        "accession_number": "0001682852-26-000033",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "At the commercial stage, we manufacture drug substance and drug product in collaboration with our contract manufacturing organizations (CMOs), both in the United States and internationally.",
        "start_character": 67816,
        "end_character": 68005
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001682852-26-000033",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001682852-26-000033-69cb479aa6f78a0f",
        "accession_number": "0001682852-26-000033",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Beyond our commercial products, we continue to demonstrate the potential of our platform technology and are advancing a pipeline of development candidates across oncology, rare disease and infectious disease.",
        "start_character": 929,
        "end_character": 1137
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001682852-26-000033",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001682852-26-000033-69cb479aa6f78a0f",
        "accession_number": "0001682852-26-000033",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "During early development of our product candidates, we manufacture drug substance and drug product for IND-enabling GLP toxicology studies and initial human clinical studies.",
        "start_character": 67557,
        "end_character": 67731
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001682852-26-000033",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001682852-26-000033-69cb479aa6f78a0f",
        "accession_number": "0001682852-26-000033",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For late clinical development, we produce mRNA and drug product for Phase 3 trials.",
        "start_character": 67732,
        "end_character": 67815
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001682852-26-000033",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001682852-26-000033-69cb479aa6f78a0f",
        "accession_number": "0001682852-26-000033",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, we face competition from others developing mRNA medicines, as well as other medicines that compete or could compete with our products.",
        "start_character": 118829,
        "end_character": 118972
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001682852-26-000033",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001682852-26-000033-69cb479aa6f78a0f",
        "accession_number": "0001682852-26-000033",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2025, we began construction at the MTC campus for new commercial drug product manufacturing and packaging capability to enable full end-to-end manufacturing for our mRNA medicines in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 69490,
        "end_character": 69684
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001682852-26-000033",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001682852-26-000033-69cb479aa6f78a0f",
        "accession_number": "0001682852-26-000033",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2025, we delivered a targeted learning portfolio focused on practical AI skills designed to build durable habits and fundamentally change how employees work.",
